<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<div type="elementDocumentation" xml:id="elem-formAvailableId" xmlns:ead="https://archivists.org/ns/ead/v4" xmlns:eac="http://archivists.org/ns/eac/v2" xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3c.org/1999/xlink">
	<head>
		<gi>formAvailableId</gi>
	</head>
	<div type="fullName">
		<p>Identifier of the Form Available</p>
	</div>
	<div type="summary">
		<p>A child element of <gi>formAvailable</gi> that provides an identifier for the instantiation being described, e.g. a microfiche number.</p>
	</div>
	<div type="mayContain">
		<p>
			<list type="gloss">
				<label>[text]</label>
				<item/>
				<label>reference</label>
				<item>0..n</item>
				<label>referringString</label>
				<item>0..n</item>
				<label>span</label>
				<item>0..n</item>
			</list>
		</p>
	</div>
	<div type="mayOccurWithin">
		<p>formAvailable</p>
	</div>
	<div type="attributes">
		<p>
			<list type="gloss">
				<label>audience</label>
				<item>Optional</item>
				<label>conventionDeclarationReference</label>
				<item>Optional</item>
				<label>id</label>
				<item>Optional</item>
				<label>languageOfElement</label>
				<item>Optional</item>
				<label>localType</label>
				<item>Optional</item>
				<label>localTypeDeclarationReference</label>
				<item>Optional</item>
				<label>maintenanceEventReference</label>
				<item>Optional</item>
				<label>scriptOfElement</label>
				<item>Optional</item>
				<label>sourceReference</label>
				<item>Optional</item>
				<label>target</label>
				<item>Optional</item>
				<label>valueURI</label>
				<item>Optional</item>
				<label>vocabularySource</label>
				<item>Optional</item>
				<label>vocabularySourceURI</label>
				<item>Optional</item>
			</list>
		</p>
	</div>
	<div type="description">
		<p><gi>formAvailableId</gi> may contain any alpha-numeric text string that serves as a unique reference point or control number for the described instantiation.</p>
	</div>
	<div type="attributeusage">
		<p>Use <att>valueURI</att> to provide a number, code, or string (e.g., URI) that uniquely and persistently identifies the instantiation in a controlled vocabulary, taxonomy, ontology, or other knowledge organization system. Use <att>vocabularySource</att> and/or <att>vocabularySourceURI</att> to name and/or point to the organization system used.</p>
	</div>	
	<div type="seealso">
		<p>Use <gi>unitId</gi> to provide an identifier for the record resource in general, which is different from, though might provide a basis for the identifiers used for its specific instantiations encoded in <gi>formAvailableId</gi>.</p>
	</div>
	<div type="availability">
		<p>Required, Repeatable</p>
	</div>
	<div type="examples">
		<egXML xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/Examples">
			<![CDATA[<formsAvailable>
			<formAvailable valueURI="https://collections.library.yale.edu/catalog/2008313" coverage="whole" formAvailableType="digitalDerived">
			<label>The Pippa and Porthos</label>
			<formAvailableId valueURI="https://collections.library.yale.edu/iiif/2/1044151/full/full/0/default.jpg">The Pippa and Porthos (cover)</formAvailableId>
			<formAvailableId valueURI="https://collections.library.yale.edu/iiif/2/1044153/full/full/0/default.jpg">The Pippa and Porthos (titlepage)</formAvailableId>
			<formAvailableId valueURI="https://collections.library.yale.edu/iiif/2/1044154/full/full/0/default.jpg">The Pippa and Porthos (p. 1)</formAvailableId>
			[...]
			<descriptiveNote>
			<p>Digitized pages of Barrie’s "The Pippa and Porthos."</p>
		</descriptiveNote>
		</formAvailable>
		</formsAvailable>]]>
		</egXML>
		<egXML xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/Examples">
			<![CDATA[<formAvailable>
			<label>Microfilm reels</label>
			<formAvailableId>MF1993-034:1</formAvailableId>
			<formAvailableId>MF1993-034:2</formAvailableId>
			<formAvailableId>MF1993-034:3</formAvailableId>
			<descriptiveNote>
			<p>This collection has been microfilmed and is available on three reels MF1993-034:1 to MF1993-034:3.</p>
			<p>Researchers interested in purchasing microfilm copies should contact the repository.</p>
		</descriptiveNote>
		</formAvailable>]]>
		</egXML>
	</div>
</div>
